&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate, develop features for and maintain autonomous aerial vehicles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement algorithms in control, estimation, system state monitoring and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test in simulation and in real flights, evaluate performance and iterate quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and report procedures and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
