&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final-year Master’s student or graduate in mechanical, electrical, computer science, robotics or related engineering field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software development experience. C++ preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of GNC topics such as system dynamics, state estimation, and control, applied to real-world robotic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with robotic hardware and electronics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with Git and Linux.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
