&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Experience with CI/CD systems, such as Jenkins, GitHub actions, GitLab CI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile environment, providing daily updates in stand-ups and managing tasks in a sprint board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product-oriented mindset, with an eagerness to drive forward project initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
