&lt;p&gt;As a Supply Chain Specialist, you will be responsible for the end-to-end supply chain processes of Auterion products. You will collaborate closely with cross-functional teams and external partners, while providing the overall strategic and operational oversight necessary to ensure excellence across our global value chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the planning, controlling, and optimization of supply chain processes, including procurement, logistics, warehousing, scheduling, and order management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and eliminate bottlenecks, redundancies, and inefficiencies across the supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary operational go-to person between purchasing, production planning, logistics, engineering and sales — ensuring information flows smoothly and handoffs are seamless&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, design, and implement improvements to supply chain processes and tools, including&amp;nbsp; ERP configuration, reporting enhancements, and workflow automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document processes, develop standard operating procedures, and drive adoption&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and analyze reports, providing timely and accurate reporting on KPIs (e.g., delivery performance, inventory levels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively support daily operations and cross-functional projects&lt;/li&gt;
